e":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2976"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-24T17:18:29-08:00","id":57087,"title":"","content":"Does anyone feel it would be presumptuous to start other threads to discuss what we want to see for the other Ability Charm Trees which are not yet finished?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>formerly Tornado Wolf, formerly Inugami","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/636-sunder-the-gold","name":"Sunder the Gold","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar636_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5515"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-24T17:52:49-08:00","id":57109,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Blaque</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/solar-exalted/52328-tell-me-what-you-want-re-solar-performance?p=57016#post57016\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">The production value was kind of ghetto, but wlel, TV miniseries in 2001ish isn't going to be spectacular. They got a few really good castings I feel (like the guy they got for Paul) but also some fails (their Stilgar sucked).<br /> <br /> The <i>Children of Dune </i>miniseries covers the second and third books and while I haven't seen that, I hear it did it in a way that actually was less creepy on some aspects and way less contrivance-filled.<br /> <br /> And stuff.</div> </div> </div> </div>Keep in mind, I was shocked because I was expecting another &quot;supercroc vs anaconda!&quot; shitfest. It was actually very good, and with the budget they had (Think Dr. Who 70s-era budget) they did very well.<br /> <br /> Children of Dune was much better than I was expecting.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Sure, there's no way to canonically do it, but Exalted allows you to knee canon in the crotch and rifle through its pockets to take what you need while it whimpers on the ground. - mockery","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/374-nocte-ex-mortis","name":"Nocte ex Mortis","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar374_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"486"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-26T09:13:27-08:00","id":58123,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Sunder the Gold</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/solar-exalted/52328-tell-me-what-you-want-re-solar-performance?p=57087#post57087\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Does anyone feel it would be presumptuous to start other threads to discuss what we want to see for the other Ability Charm Trees which are not yet finished?</div> </div> </div> </div>It should be fine on that count as long as you frame it in terms of &quot;this would be interesting to know&quot; instead of &quot;let's give the devteam ideas.&quot;<br /> <br /> EDIT: Hell, I'll do it myself.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":97,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/97-